Notes

 =


Please note that I have found a crash of oFono when running two STK TCs in a
row: =


Bug <https://bugs.meego.com/show_bug.cgi?id=3D25998>  25998 - oFono crashes
when doing a NAA Initialization+File Change Notification after having done a
NAA Initialization+Full File Change Notification with Phonesim.

